/oCancellation are useful when zapped at monsters that cast spells, can
charm/seduce you (nymphs, foocubi) and stopping shape changers from
changing forms (mimics, chameleons).

Another use for it is to cancel cursed items or to bring the
enchantment of an item to +0 (careful as it will make the item uncursed
even if it was blessed).  Zapping or casting cancellation at magical
potions turns them into uncursed potions of water.  This is useful when
making holy water.

The last use of the wand is to create uncursed blank scrolls and
uncursed blank spellbooks.  No matter what the initial scroll or
spellbook was, when cancelled it becomes blank and uncursed.



